{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "story_kroos_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_kroos_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "蘋果",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_kroos_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "4511524e057476d3586608a99a6de3e3ac37e842952581871acf093e000b7975",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "某個閒暇清晨\n羅德島主艦"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "我怎麼又被克洛絲繞進去了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格魯",
      "text": "別生氣啦，隊長，克洛絲沒有惡意的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "不是生氣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "就是——明明我在監督她幹活，怎麼每次......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格魯",
      "text": "她只是想多放鬆一會啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "下次還是你盯著克洛絲吧，她好像比較聽你的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格魯",
      "text": "我也沒做什麼啦，就是盯著她幹活。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格魯",
      "text": "如果她有事情，我就幫她一起幹，過一會她就不讓我做了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "就這樣？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格魯",
      "text": "嗯，沒什麼特別的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "不愧是你啊，米格魯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "也不知道為什麼，她只要想偷懶，我就攔不住......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "有時候是肚子不舒服、有時候杜賓教官找，我怎麼就信了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "等我反應過來，人已經溜掉了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "唉......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "克洛絲！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "可算讓我找到你了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "別跑！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "米格魯你去那邊堵她！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格魯",
      "text": "唉？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格魯",
      "text": "好，好的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "呼，呼呼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "克洛絲，跟我回去值日！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "（我就休息一下嘛！）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "站住！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "（呀，芬怎麼越跑越快了！）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "（我得想個辦法。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "text": "您還想聽點什麼嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稀音",
      "text": "嗯......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "text": "好的，鏡頭在曲庫裡搜尋一下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "（是稀音嗎？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "（嗯......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "（好，試試看吧。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "您好~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "text": "啊，克洛絲小姐您好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "我可以坐在稀音旁邊嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "text": "哦——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "text": "小姐說她不介意，請坐吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "謝謝~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "呼，呼——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "text": "您好像很累的樣子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "因為，後面有一隻庫蘭塔在追呀~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "克洛絲！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "text": "啊，我也聽到了，是芬小姐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "其實我和芬在捉迷藏呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "結果抓著抓著，就變成賽跑了~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "鏡頭，幫幫忙吧~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "text": "哦——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稀音",
      "text": "嗯......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "text": "小姐說聽上去很有趣，讓鏡頭給克洛絲小姐提供幫助。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "謝謝~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "text": "但是，我沒法保證您不被芬小姐認出來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "要是真被抓住，那我也就只好乖乖認輸啦~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "text": "既然您都這麼說了——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡子",
      "text": "嗶嗶！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "M.P.M一號",
      "text": "嘀——嘀——嘀——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "M.P.M二號",
      "text": "叮咚！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "（這些小車一直都藏在旁邊嗎，我都沒發現呢。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡子",
      "text": "嗶嗶！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "M.P.M一號",
      "text": "嘀——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "M.P.M二號",
      "text": "叮咚叮咚！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "剛剛應該是在這裡跳了一下就不見了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "人呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "這傢伙越來越會躲了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稀音",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "如果是克洛絲的話......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "應該會——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "藏在——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格魯",
      "text": "芬——我看到克洛絲往食堂那邊去了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "好，我這就來！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "呼——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "text": "恭喜，看來克洛絲小姐沒有被抓住呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "以前在出任務的時候看到過稀音的藏身手法。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "果然很厲害呢~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "text": "鏡頭使用的是最新研製的複合隱蔽技術，融合了迷彩、光線折射等多種科技。主要是為了滿足小姐的需求。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稀音",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "text": "對不起小姐，忘記給您播放音樂了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "text": "那麼——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "哈——真好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "我也在這裡休息一會，可以嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稀音",
      "text": "嗯......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "text": "歡迎！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "說起來，稀音小姐現在在做什麼呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "text": "小姐在構思作品。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "text": "雖然看上去只是在發呆，但小姐這時候的確是在思考。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "text": "這時候鏡頭就負責給小姐放音樂和遞食物。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "沒有人會追著稀音小姐幹活嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "text": "從鏡頭的記錄裡來看——好像沒有。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "text": "如果有的話，鏡頭就會為小姐使用隱蔽技術，沒人能找得到她。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "真好~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "如果我也能像稀音一樣生活就好了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "text": "小姐好像也說過類似的話。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "text": "好像是：“能夠像卡特斯那樣生活就好了。”——之類的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "卡特斯有什麼好嘛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "很累的~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "從小到大都被人說，卡特斯不是應該活潑好動嗎，你怎麼就這麼懶。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "但我就是想把腦袋放空，然後在沙發上待一天。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "這樣不是很好嗎~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稀音",
      "text": "嗯......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "text": "小姐說，克洛絲有選擇的權力，已經很幸福了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "text": "用鏡頭來打個比方吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "text": "鏡頭抓拍的速度是很快的，經過系統輔助運算，就算是飛奔的庫蘭塔，鏡頭也能抓拍成功然後把照片放進相冊裡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "text": "但小姐是做不到的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "text": "就算是拍攝人物，小姐也要像畫素描一樣，等——上很久。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "text": "所以小姐景物拍得好，並不是因為小姐只喜歡景物。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "text": "小姐什麼都想拍，但她能拍到的，只有近乎靜止的東西，只有它們，才有耐心一直等在那裡，等著小姐拍完。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "text": "這就是原因。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "text": "克洛絲雖然不喜歡動，但真正活動起來，還是很敏捷的吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "算是吧~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "text": "鏡頭和卡達編輯過有克洛絲參加的作戰記錄。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "text": "平常都是在預定地點附近，但是要求來了也可以很迅速地轉移，和普通的卡特斯沒什麼區別。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "那只是因為不好好幹就沒命了嘛~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "任務很辛苦的~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "text": "可沒有鏡頭幫忙，稀音小姐連轉移都做不到。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "text": "“做不到”和“不想做”，鏡頭覺得還是有些區別的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "嗯......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "text": "“太多的事情做不了，所以就讓我們把能做的事做到最好。”",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "text": "稀音小姐是這麼和鏡頭說的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "text": "當然了，小姐能做到的事其實也比較少，做起來也比較方便。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "text": "對於克洛絲來說，是不是因為知道自己的極限，所以只把精力放在最需要自己努力的地方呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "有可能哦~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "text": "看來鏡頭的判斷是正確的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "也有可能只是不想幹活。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "text": "鏡頭相信克洛絲小姐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "text": "滋，滋滋——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "怎麼了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "text": "啊，不好意思，這裡信號不太好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "text": "鏡頭剛剛為您選選取的勵勵志程式運行出錯了了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "呃......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "text": "您看需不需不需要要要要要——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "text": "——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "唉？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "鏡頭？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "text": "——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "（旁邊的小車也不動了。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "（這是，壞了？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稀音",
      "text": "——!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "稀音，你是要說什麼嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稀音",
      "text": "呣——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "慢慢來，我聽著呢~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稀音",
      "text": "唔——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稀音",
      "text": "欸——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "我猜猜~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "唔，是——梅爾嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稀音",
      "text": "是————",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "我知道啦，我去找梅爾，稀音就在這裡守著鏡頭吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "不會過太久的~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "一會見~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稀音",
      "text": "是————",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稀音",
      "text": "的————",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格魯",
      "text": "不好意思啊芬，我認錯人了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "萊恩哈特先生和克洛絲差別還是挺大的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "雖然都是卡特斯......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格魯",
      "text": "真的很抱歉，一著急看錯了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "沒事，我們重新找找看，如果找不到，就去請流星小姐或者遠山小姐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "克洛絲逃不掉的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格魯",
      "text": "今天隊長好像對克洛絲特別有意見呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格魯",
      "text": "平時不也是睜一隻眼閉一隻眼的嗎，今天好像特別生氣的樣子。",
