    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "不是生氣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "今天克洛絲開溜的時候和我說。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格魯",
      "text": "和你說？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "說今天是我帶領大家的周年紀念日，想先給我買點禮物去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格魯",
      "text": "那不是很好嘛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "結果她一出門就沒回來，等你回宿舍我才反應過來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格魯",
      "text": "今天真的是紀念日嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "是的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格魯",
      "text": "那克洛絲也太過分了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格魯",
      "text": "一會我會幫你說說她的。",
