    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "text": "其實您剛一走鏡頭就重啟了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "text": "因為鏡頭有些功能容易出錯，重啟還是很常見的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "那......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "text": "啊您是說小姐嗎？小姐想和您說的是：“沒事的。”",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "text": "可能小姐的音調太——長，導致您誤會她的意思了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "是，這樣啊~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稀音",
      "text": "嗯......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "那我不是白跑一趟嘛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "text": "不好意思啦梅爾小姐，鏡頭健康得很。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "嗯，我看看......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "應該不是外部的問題。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "之前的確當機了對吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "text": "是的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "那就是機體本身存在問題。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "剛剛你自己也說，重啟很常見，對嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "可露希爾怎麼沒幫你解決這問題？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "text": "可露希爾小姐已經為鏡頭預訂了更新配件，再過不久就可以升級了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "哦？哦——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "那批零件原來是給你的啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "昨天我去她小黑屋的時候她還跟我裝了半天。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "說是什麼“高級移動攝影器材在極端條件下使用的精尖零件”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "原來就是你啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "那正好，我們現在就去可露希爾那裡一趟，我和她一起幫你解決這個問題。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "這樣你出任務的時候就不存在當場當機的可能性了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "text": "感謝您，梅爾小姐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "text": "但小姐她行動不太方便，鏡頭要和小姐一起走，可能沒辦法直接和您去可露希爾小姐那裡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "我會帶她慢慢過去的~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "可以吧，稀音小姐~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稀音",
      "text": "嗯——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "text": "既然小姐都這麼說了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅爾",
      "text": "嗯，那就出發吧，早點收工，我能早睡一會，明天還有一大堆活要幹呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏡頭",
      "text": "哎呀梅爾小姐，不要推著我跑啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稀音",
      "text": "嗯——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "沒事的，梅爾小姐只是性子比較急~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "我們就慢慢晃過去好了~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "我認路的~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "稀音",
      "text": "嗯......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "行動預備組A1宿舍"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "我回來啦~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "哦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格魯",
      "text": "回來啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "芬，這是給你買的甜點~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "紀念日快樂！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格魯",
      "text": "哇，是小瑪芬！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "謝謝。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "放桌上就好，明天一起分著吃。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "好的~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "浴室有人用嗎~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格魯",
      "text": "我們都上床啦，就剩你了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "好~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格魯",
      "text": "你看嘛芬，克洛絲真的努力了一天哦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格魯",
      "text": "而且給你買了禮物。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "啊——嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "其實我也不是想責怪她。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "她要是真的想休息，和我說，我也不會拒絕的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "但她總是用那種方法，有時候是讓我有點不開心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格魯",
      "text": "克洛絲只是不好意思說出口啦，她人很好的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "我覺得她是在耍我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格魯",
      "text": "那是因為和你關係好嘛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格魯",
      "text": "克洛絲對大多數人都不會這樣的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "唉，那我寧願她對我正常點......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "早點睡吧，我們明天還要訓練呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "記得起來以後叫醒克洛絲，她回來的時候看上去確實很疲憊，我怕她明天起不來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "要是真睡過頭，杜賓教官......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格魯",
      "text": "安心啦芬，我會把她拖起來的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "但願如此......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "唔，不想了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "睡覺睡覺。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "晚安。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格魯",
      "text": "晚安，隊長。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
